OL,3,CSummer of free bus travel starts for
OL,4,Cchildren in England
OL,6,FA month of free bus travel for under-
OL,7,F16s in England has started in a bid to
OL,8,Fease cost-of-living pressures on
OL,9,Ffamilies during the school summer
OL,10,Fholidays.
OL,12,FThe offer is part of the government's
OL,13,FGreat British Summer Savings scheme,
OL,14,Fwhich has seen VAT cut on children's
OL,15,Fcinema and theatre tickets, restaurant
OL,16,Fmeals and family attractions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
