OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1785559663
OL,3,CSummer of free bus travel starts for
OL,4,Cchildren in England
OL,6,FThe Department for Transport
OL,7,Fidentified several popular sites which
OL,8,Fcan be visited using free bus travel
OL,9,Ffor children, such as York Dungeon,
OL,10,FWindsor Castle and the National Space
OL,11,FCentre in Leicester.
OL,13,FBus fares usually cost #1-#2 for
OL,14,Fchildren aged five to 15. Bus travel
OL,15,Fis free for under-5s.
OL,17,FLast week, the government announced it
OL,18,Fwill reintroduce a #2 cap on bus fares
OL,19,Ffor all passengers from the start of
OL,20,Fnext year, down from the current cap
OL,21,Fof #3.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
