OL,3,CSummer of free bus travel starts for
OL,4,Cchildren in England
OL,6,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,12,Fsaid: "We're giving families room to
OL,13,Fbreathe from the cost-of-living
OL,14,Fsqueeze.
OL,16,F"With free bus travel for five to 15-
OL,17,Fyear-olds and discounts on kids' meals
OL,18,Fat restaurants, cinema tickets and
OL,19,Ftheme parks, we're helping people make
OL,20,Fthe most of the time they have
OL,21,Ftogether for the school holidays.
